1	<script lang="ts">
2		/**
3		 * CategoryDropdown Component
4		 *
5		 * Implements:
6		 * - #{#exp2a authority=developer} - Category Assignment UI
7		 * - #{#exp3b authority=developer} - Create New Category Inline
8		 *
9		 * Specification: specs/specifications/expense-categorization.md
10		 * Priority: High
11		 *
12		 * Features:
13		 * - Display current category or "Uncategorized"
14		 * - Searchable dropdown with all categories
15		 * - Keyboard navigation (Arrow keys, Enter, Escape)
16		 * - Click outside to close
17		 * - Inline category creation with validation
